@startuml strong-bisimulation-evidence
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam ArrowColor #607D8B
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.4
skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 12
  FontColor #102027
}

title <b>Certified strong-bisimulation evidence</b>\n<size:11>formal contract · executable refinement · independent replay · bounded acceptance</size>

rectangle "<b>Normative contract</b>\nlabelled transfer in both directions\nvalidated input · canonical relation\ncertificate · witness · resource envelope" as CONTRACT #FFF59D

rectangle "<b>Rocq</b>\nunbounded equivalence\ncertificate exactness\nmodal witness soundness/completeness\ntermination and resource inequalities" as ROCQ #FFCDD2
rectangle "<b>TLA+ / TLC</b>\n14,916 valid lifecycle states\n3 malformed dense-input modes\nsafety and eventual termination" as TLA #FFCDD2
rectangle "<b>Z3</b>\n15 exact SAT/UNSAT controls\nvalidation · refinement · canonicality\nwork · heap · native stack" as SMT #E1BEE7
rectangle "<b>Executable oracle</b>\n5,124 complete small LTS/color cases\nindependent greatest fixed point\nstack-safe characteristic formulas" as ORACLE #C8E6C9
rectangle "<b>Mutation controls</b>\n10 injected semantic defects\nall killed for their named reason" as MUTANTS #FFCDD2
rectangle "<b>Invariant ledger</b>\n97 exhaustive formal rows\n13 implementation properties\nno unregistered theorem or control" as LEDGER #FFF59D
rectangle "<b>Required-green Rust</b>\n13 generated properties\nall execute against CertifiedBisimulation" as GREEN #C8E6C9
rectangle "<b>Production Valmari core</b>\nvalidated radix + dual CSR\nrefinable state/transition partitions\nguarded modal split trace" as CORE #BBDEFB
rectangle "<b>Independent replay</b>\nrebuild guards and formulas\nvalidate every split + final stability\nnever call the producer" as REPLAY #FFCDD2
rectangle "<b>Bounded acceptance</b>\n100,000-state / 64 KiB stack\nCriterion crossover matrix\nheadless heaptrack: 89.03 MiB RSS" as ACCEPT #FFE0B2

CONTRACT -down-> ROCQ
CONTRACT -down-> TLA
CONTRACT -down-> SMT
ROCQ -down-> LEDGER
TLA -down-> LEDGER
SMT -down-> LEDGER
CONTRACT -down-> ORACLE
ORACLE -down-> MUTANTS
MUTANTS -down-> GREEN
LEDGER -down-> GREEN
CORE -down-> GREEN
CORE -down-> REPLAY
GREEN -down-> ACCEPT
REPLAY -down-> ACCEPT

note right of ACCEPT
  No unchecked proof escapes.
  No malformed endpoint is skipped.
  No recursive production traversal.
  No whole-partition rescans.
  No GUI profiler or tmpfs scratch.
end note
@enduml
